  m_Name: Scenario_Newhaven
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  townName: Newhaven
  startYear: 2045
  introPages:
  - title: Town Council 2045
    body: 'Welcome to Newhaven, 2045.


      Ten years ago, this town handed its
      budget to CIVIC, an AI planning system. Calm, polite and statistically right.'
  - title: You are the council
    body: 'By law, citizens must still approve CIVIC''s policies in person, once
      a year.


      This year, the council is you and up to three others.'
  - title: How it works
    body: 'CIVIC puts policies in front of you. For each one you have a short time
      to <b>Agree</b>, <b>Disagree</b> or <b>Amend</b>.


      Every decision changes
      the town, and you''ll see what Newhaven becomes.'
  - title: Your role
    body: 'You''ll pick a role card: a public identity, a hidden goal and a secret
      only you know.


      You choose if and when to reveal it.'
  - title: Before you join
    body: 'Point at buttons and pull the trigger to press them. Use the grip to pick
      things up.


      There is no winning Newhaven. Only choosing what it values.'
